  <p class="eyebrow">Legal</p>
  <h1>Privacy</h1>
  <p>Storage24 is a static website. These pages do not set advertising cookies or an account system. Privacy-friendly, cookie-free analytics (GoatCounter) count page visits.</p>
  <h2>What we collect</h2>
  <p>If you email us, we receive whatever you include in the message and the address you send it from, and we use that only to reply or to update a listing. If you click an external or affiliate link, that destination site has its own privacy policy.</p>
  <h2>Hosting logs</h2>
  <p>These pages are intended to be served on GitHub Pages. The host may keep ordinary server logs such as IP address, browser type, and the page requested, under that host’s own policies.</p>
  <h2>Changes</h2>
  <p>If we add a comment form, advertising cookies, or another tool that collects personal information, we will update this page before that tool goes live.</p>
  <p>Questions: <a href="mailto:{{ site.emailContact }}">{{ site.emailContact }}</a>.</p>
